Escalation & Alerting a supervisor (and, by rule, central administration) when a task passes its deadline. \\
Public information & Information approved for viewing by unauthenticated users. \\
Visitor pass & A record in the retained Visitors module. Not to be confused with a \emph{public user}. \\
