FR-5.6 & The system shall create action items with department, optional assignee, priority, status (Open/In Progress/Resolved), due time and resolution note. & High & Planned \\
FR-5.7 & An operational change and its event shall be committed together using a database transaction where supported; otherwise an explicit, tested recovery strategy shall prevent silent event loss. & High & Planned \\
FR-5.8 & Supervisors shall be able to assign and reassign their department's action items. & Medium & Planned \\
