FR-8.4 & The system shall record escalation and resolution times, and shall stop further escalation once the task is resolved. & Medium & Planned \\
FR-8.5 & A scheduled server-side check shall evaluate overdue tasks at a configurable interval (default one minute). & Medium & Planned \\
\end{reqtable}

