\section{Key Features Summary}
\begin{itemize}
    \item One application, one login entry point, and a workspace per role and department.
    \item Clear ownership: departments edit only what they own and see only what they need.
    \item Public information without login; private passenger data visible only to its owner.
    \item Automatic, rule-based notifications and follow-up tasks across departments.
