NFR-5 & Important concurrent updates shall not silently overwrite newer data; version checks or conditional updates shall detect conflicts. & Medium & Planned \\
NFR-6 & Event processing and notification creation shall be idempotent on retry and shall record failures that need recovery. & High & Planned \\
