\section{Security and Privacy Requirements}
\begin{reqtable}
NFR-8 & The system shall not expose passwords, JWT secrets, database credentials, internal incident payloads or another passenger's private data. The repository currently contains a committed \texttt{.env} file, which must be removed and its secrets rotated. & High & Partial \\
NFR-9 & Every protected operation shall enforce backend authorization, including direct API requests that bypass the frontend. & High & Implemented \\
