\noindent\textbf{Data design rules}
\begin{itemize}
    \item Use references for shared records such as flights rather than independent copies of flight details.
    \item Minimize personal data in events and notifications; use references and allowlisted display fields.
    \item Use a unique key per event and recipient so that reprocessing cannot create duplicate notifications.
    \item Use record versioning or conditional updates for important concurrently edited records.
    \item Use database transactions for an operational update and its event where supported; otherwise implement and test a recovery strategy.
\end{itemize}

